From 49a9bd87c00adfde03b20792e127fabc4a3d892c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BEL <bel@H100-VM1.mzqbi1zdpcje1jsioelsqu3tog.rx.internal.cloudapp.net>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 05:47:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] [wip](kt-kernel): three-tier expert store, per-expert
 movement, shm staging

Working-tree state as of the expert-streaming-hybrid experiments. Snapshotted
for backup; not all of this is validated.

- cpu_expert_opts.h / cpu_expert_profile.h: per-expert options + timing profile
- expert_store_shm.h: shared-memory expert store so all 256 experts can be
  staged (the shipped dynamic-update path evicts into MISSING weights)
- task_queue / worker_pool / cpuinfer: queue-depth control for the CPU submit
  path; head-of-line blocking is what made streaming cost +31.7% decode
- moe_base / rawint4_packed_avx512vnni-moe: per-expert promote/evict hooks
- ext_bindings / amx.py: python side of the above

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
